      "subtitles": [
        {
          "index": 1,
          "start": 0.0,
          "end": 5.68,
          "relative_start": 0.0,
          "relative_end": 5.68,
          "en": "Well, from all of the frameworks, dolian should be lower. The classic frameworks. We should be talking 140, 150.",
          "zh": "从所有框架来看，日元应该走低。经典框架下，我们该讨论140、150的水平。",
          "zh_highlights": [
            "日元应该走低"
          ],
          "en_highlights": [
            "dolian should be lower"
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "start": 5.68,
          "end": 12.0,
          "relative_start": 5.68,
          "relative_end": 12.0,
          "en": "If you use interest rate spreads as your guide, that's why a lot of guests would have come on your show and say the weakness in the end is going to be short term.",
          "zh": "如果以利差为指引，很多嘉宾会说日元弱势是短期的。",
          "zh_highlights": [
            "利差为指引"
          ],
          "en_highlights": [
            "interest rate spreads"
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "start": 12.0,
          "end": 17.52,
          "relative_start": 12.0,
          "relative_end": 17.52,
          "en": "I think dolian heads low into year-end. But there's been a change in the flow behaviors of the Japanese space.",
          "zh": "我认为日元年底前会走低，但日本市场的资金流动行为已发生变化。",
          "zh_highlights": [
            "资金流动行为已发生变化"
          ],
          "en_highlights": [
            "change in the flow behaviors"
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 4,
          "start": 17.52,
          "end": 20.8,
          "relative_start": 17.52,
          "relative_end": 20.8,
          "en": "It doesn't look like a G10 currency. It trades like an EM.",
          "zh": "它不像G10货币，更像新兴市场货币。",
          "zh_highlights": [
            "更像新兴市场货币"
          ],
          "en_highlights": [
            "trades like an EM"
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 5,
          "start": 20.8,
          "end": 25.28,
          "relative_start": 20.8,
          "relative_end": 25.28,
          "en": "In terms of its correlation to rates, it has flipped. It's got a negative correlation to rates right now.",
          "zh": "与利率的相关性已经反转，目前呈负相关。",
          "zh_highlights": [
            "相关性已经反转"
          ],
          "en_highlights": [
            "correlation to rates"
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 6,
          "start": 25.28,
          "end": 30.4,
          "relative_start": 25.28,
          "relative_end": 30.4,
          "en": "And this is something that we don't usually talk about. What we have spoken about for the UK over Brexit, all these other things.",
          "zh": "这是我们通常不讨论的。我们曾讨论过英国脱欧等情况。",
          "zh_highlights": [
            "通常不讨论"
          ],
          "en_highlights": [
            "don't usually talk about"
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 7,
          "start": 30.4,
          "end": 36.8,
          "relative_start": 30.4,
          "relative_end": 36.8,
          "en": "And that was when everyone was worrying about the fiscal side in the UK. So is it the same concern over in the states in Japan?",
          "zh": "当时大家担心英国财政问题。那么美国和日本也有同样担忧吗？",
          "zh_highlights": [
            "同样担忧"
          ],
          "en_highlights": [
            "same concern"
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 8,
          "start": 36.8,
          "end": 42.32,
          "relative_start": 36.8,
          "relative_end": 42.32,
          "en": "There's definitely concerns. We're waiting to see what the consumption tax cut will be on food and what other ways they're going to fund that.",
          "zh": "确实有担忧。我们等待看食品消费税减免以及如何融资。",
          "zh_highlights": [
            "消费税减免"
          ],
          "en_highlights": [
            "consumption tax cut"
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 9,
          "start": 42.32,
          "end": 50.32,
          "relative_start": 42.32,
          "relative_end": 50.32,
          "en": "They said they'll fund it from higher revenues. But the market thinks it's sniffing around, thinking there's going to be some extra deficit financing bonds.",
          "zh": "官方称将通过更高收入融资，但市场认为可能发行额外赤字融资债券。",
          "zh_highlights": [
            "额外赤字融资债券"
          ],
          "en_highlights": [
            "extra deficit financing bonds"
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 10,
          "start": 50.32,
          "end": 55.56,
          "relative_start": 50.32,
          "relative_end": 55.56,
          "en": "But the main point is Japan's not on EM. And actually, we've seen massive inflows in Japan.",
          "zh": "但关键是日本并非新兴市场。实际上，我们看到日本有大量资金流入。",
          "zh_highlights": [
            "大量资金流入"
          ],
          "en_highlights": [
            "massive inflows"
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 11,
          "start": 55.56,
          "end": 61.0,
          "relative_start": 55.56,
          "relative_end": 61.0,
          "en": "The biggest inflows in fact over the past year by foreign investors into both JGBs and equities.",
          "zh": "过去一年，外国市场参与者对日本国债和权益资产的最大资金流入。",
          "zh_highlights": [
            "最大资金流入",
            "权益资产"
          ],
          "en_highlights": [
            "biggest inflows",
            "JGBs and equities"
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 12,
          "start": 61.0,
          "end": 65.12,
          "relative_start": 61.0,
          "relative_end": 65.12,
          "en": "But those foreign investors, after Liberation Day, are massively hedging their exposure.",
          "zh": "但解放日后，这些外国市场参与者大规模对冲了敞口。",
          "zh_highlights": [
            "解放日后"
          ],
          "en_highlights": [
            "Liberation Day",
            "hedging their exposure"
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 13,
          "start": 65.12,
          "end": 71.2,
          "relative_start": 65.12,
          "relative_end": 71.2,
          "en": "So you've got that inflow into Japan, potentially crowding out Japanese investors who are also investing abroad.",
          "zh": "资金流入日本，可能挤出了也在海外**的日本市场参与者。",
          "zh_highlights": [
            "资金流入",
            "挤出"
          ],
          "en_highlights": [
            "inflow into Japan",
            "crowding out"
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 14,
          "start": 71.2,
          "end": 78.44,
          "relative_start": 71.2,
          "relative_end": 78.44,
          "en": "But they don't FX hedge the same way as foreign investors, because they have to pay for that FX hedge, where Europeans and US get paid for it.",
          "zh": "但他们不像外国市场参与者那样进行外汇对冲，因为日本市场参与者需支付对冲成本，而欧美市场参与者则能获得收益。",
          "zh_highlights": [
            "外汇对冲"
          ],
          "en_highlights": [
            "FX hedge",
            "pay for that FX hedge"
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 15,
          "start": 78.44,
          "end": 82.36,
          "relative_start": 78.44,
          "relative_end": 82.36,
          "en": "So that's your question. We've had a big carry trade, where a lot of hedge friends are short.",
          "zh": "这就是问题所在。我们经历了一场大规模套利交易，许多对冲基金做空日元。",
          "zh_highlights": [
            "套利交易",
            "做空日元"
          ],
          "en_highlights": [
            "carry trade",
            "short"
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 16,
          "start": 82.36,
          "end": 86.8,
          "relative_start": 82.36,
          "relative_end": 86.8,
          "en": "The yen, a lot of CTAs and trend following accounts. Yesterday looked like something different.",
          "zh": "许多CTA和趋势跟踪账户也做空。但昨天情况有所不同。",
          "zh_highlights": [
            "CTA",
            "趋势跟踪"
          ],
          "en_highlights": [
            "CTAs",
            "trend following"
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 17,
          "start": 86.8,
          "end": 87.8,
          "relative_start": 86.8,
          "relative_end": 87.8,
          "en": "And we had that report.",
          "zh": "我们收到了那份报告。",
          "zh_highlights": [
            "报告"
          ],
          "en_highlights": [
